{
    "title": "Word Find - Word Connect Games",
    "description": "\u26052000+ Levels For both Starters and Masters\r\nDifficulty increases along with levels. Easy to play, but hard to beat! \r\nIt\u2019s suitable for both starters and word masters. Come and challenge yourself!  \r\n\r\n\u2605The MOST Addictive Word Games EVER! \r\nTwo Game Models: Traditional Model and Cross Model. \r\nOne game, Two kinds of Fun.  \r\n\r\n\u2605Full of Bonus\r\nMake quest achievements to earn HUGE game money. \r\nGet rewards by finding more extra words!\r\n\r\n\u2605Amazing Spare Time Killer\r\nWith no time limits, you can use your time wisely to find new words at your own pace!\r\nWith no internet limits, you can play with or without internet.\r\n\r\n\u2605EAST TO PLAY\r\nCorrect swipe the letters horizontally, vertically, diagonally, forwards or backwards to form a specific hidden word. Find as many words as possible to unlock levels and earn extra bonus coins.\r\n\r\n\u2605Renew your Vocabulary\r\nDo you really know the words well? Is your spelling still functional? \r\nEnjoy our game and renew your vocabulary. \r\n\r\n\u2605Support Eight Languages\r\nWe support English, Deutsch, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Nederlands, Dansk, Portuguesa, Espa\u00f1ol. \r\n\r\n\u2605Download for free now! \r\n\r\nNeed Help? Have Questions?\r\nPlease contact us at funnyconnectgame@gmail.com\r\nWe really value your feedback, you can say what's on your mind when you rate the word games. Your comments will be read carefully.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u26052000+ Levels For both Starters and Masters<br>Difficulty increases along with levels. Easy to play, but hard to beat! <br>It\u2019s suitable for both starters and word masters. Come and challenge yourself!  <br><br>\u2605The MOST Addictive Word Games EVER! <br>Two Game Models: Traditional Model and Cross Model. <br>One game, Two kinds of Fun.  <br><br>\u2605Full of Bonus<br>Make quest achievements to earn HUGE game money. <br>Get rewards by finding more extra words!<br><br>\u2605Amazing Spare Time Killer<br>With no time limits, you can use your time wisely to find new words at your own pace!<br>With no internet limits, you can play with or without internet.<br><br>\u2605EAST TO PLAY<br>Correct swipe the letters horizontally, vertically, diagonally, forwards or backwards to form a specific hidden word. Find as many words as possible to unlock levels and earn extra bonus coins.<br><br>\u2605Renew your Vocabulary<br>Do you really know the words well? Is your spelling still functional? <br>Enjoy our game and renew your vocabulary. <br><br>\u2605Support Eight Languages<br>We support English, Deutsch, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Nederlands, Dansk, Portuguesa, Espa\u00f1ol. <br><br>\u2605Download for free now! <br><br>Need Help? Have Questions?<br>Please contact us at funnyconnectgame@gmail.com<br>We really value your feedback, you can say what&#39;s on your mind when you rate the word games. Your comments will be read carefully.",
